    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.poster.avif?t=1753694768\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.webm?t=1753694768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/2e15d2304a38a706723746566e9b1a92.avif?t=1753694768\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1753694768\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1753694768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.mp4?t=1753694768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.poster.avif?t=1753694768\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.webm?t=1753694768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.mp4?t=1753694768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a woman in her late 20's, struggling with the responsibility of balancing the intricacies of your relationships and your own mental stability, whilst also seeking the truth behind the mysterious death of your husband. You must navigate through a web of secrets involving a mysterious cult, personal traumas, and complex relationships.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Visual Novel/Otome Game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/e883f9e758750943c41b300ffb85113f.avif?t=1753694768\" width=620 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/7cb7b1f5734f3e43b8dd93d5af4f34b3.avif?t=1753694768\" width=620 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 Male Leads you will meet over the course of the game. Each one of them connects to you in some way or another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1753694768\" data-has-big width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1753694768\" data-has-big width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1753694768\" data-has-big width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_